# C++ Modules 00–04

![C++](https://img.shields.io/badge/C%2B%2B-98-blue)
![42](https://img.shields.io/badge/42-School-black)
![Author](https://img.shields.io/badge/author-mlima--si-lightgrey)

A collection of my first **C++ projects at 42 School**, covering **C++ Module 00 through C++ Module 04**.

These modules introduce the fundamentals of Object-Oriented Programming in C++, progressively building knowledge around classes, inheritance, polymorphism, exceptions, and abstract classes.

---

## 📚 Modules

| Module     | Main Topics                                                        |
| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **CPP 00** | Classes, member functions, namespaces, I/O streams                 |
| **CPP 01** | Memory allocation, references, pointers, file streams              |
| **CPP 02** | Orthodox Canonical Form, operator overloading, fixed-point numbers |
| **CPP 03** | Inheritance and class hierarchies                                  |
| **CPP 04** | Polymorphism, abstract classes, interfaces                         |

---

## 🧩 CPP Module 00

Introduction to C++ and Object-Oriented Programming.

### Main concepts

* Classes and objects
* Member functions
* Constructors and destructors
* `private`, `protected` and `public`
* Namespaces
* `std::string`
* Input/output streams
* `static` members

### Exercises

* **ex00** — Megaphone
* **ex01** — My Awesome PhoneBook
* **ex02** — The Job Of Your Dreams

